    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho mumwesi kwaNisani, mumuyika kwamakhumi kabili kwaAritashashita omuruchi, olwa idivai yali imbeliwe, ndachinga idivai nimuyilila omuruchi. Ne shindabeetsangakhwo neshibeela imbeliwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi niyareeba mbu Mbushiina nofwililila omubili, olwa orali omulwale ta? Mbula, shino shishichweya okhuba eshibeela shiomumwoyo. Mana ikholo niyirimukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimukalusia omuruchi mbu Omuruchi ayindile obushia nobushia! Mumoni mwanje mwakhachweya murie okhuba neshibeela, olwa litookho, habundu weshihembekho shiabakuuka banje, lili butswa likunda, ebilibwa bialio nibiasambwa nomulilo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi niyareeba mbu Kho nishiina eshia wenya khwisie? Kho nisaaya Nyasaye welikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nimuboolela omuruchi mbu Omuruchi naba nachama, khandi isie omusumbawo nimba ningoosibwa mumonitsio, ndakheenya mbu urume eYuda, khwitookho lieshihembekho shiabakuuka, endiumbashe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi niyangalusia, omukhayewe yesi niyeekhaale ninaye, ari Ne oluchendolwo lulamala tsindaalo tsinga? Kata olakalukha liina? Kho omuruchi nachama okhuruma; nasi nimulaka eshise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nimusunjila omuruchi mbu Omuruchi naba nachama, embeebwe tsibarwa khubakafuna beshialo eshili injelekha womwalo, mbu bafuchiilile embire okhuula olwa ndakhoole eYuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nende ibarwa khuAsafu omusinjilili womutsuru kwomuruchi, mbu yambeesie emisaala okhukholela ebilibwa biahabundu wamaani ahali khunzu, nokhulwa olukoba Iwelitookho, nokhulwa inzu eya ndalamenyamwo. Omuruchi niyafuchiilila ario, okhuba omukhono omulayi kwaNyasaye wanje kwali khwisie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ninzula ewabakafuna beshialo eshili injelekha womwa'o, nimbaheelesia tsibarwa tsiomuruchi. Ne omuruchi yali niyarumile nende abaseesia belihe nabachendela khufarasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa olwa Sanibalati omuHoroni, naTobia omukhalabani, omuAmoni, bahulilakhwo, kabasinyisia muno mbu omundu witsile okhuruna amalayi kabaana baIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia yatinyia abandu okhuumbakha olukoba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho ninzula eYerusalemu, nimbayo tsindaalo tsitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbuukha mushilo, isie nabandu bandi abatuutu; kata shindaboolela omundu yesi amakhuwa aka Nyasaye yali niyareele mumwoyo kwanje okhukholela Yerusalemu ta; kata shindalikhwo nomuruko kwosi ta, habula omuruko okwa ndali niniinilekhwo kwonyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nirula mushilo, nimbirila mushilibwa shiomwIbanda, ninjooma eneeYabo liAmabwe, khandi enaShilibwa shiAmasingo, ninambuula olukoba IweYerusalemu olwali nilwalikukukha, nebilibwa bialio ebiasambwa nomulilo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ninziililila okhuula khushilibwa shieisebele, nokhwitiba liomuruchi; ne shibwaliho obwiyango obwa omuruko okwa ndali niniinilekhwo okhubirilayo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nindikulukha mushilo, nimbirila hamuchela, ninambuula olukoba; nishiukhana ninzinjilila muShilibwa shiomwIbanda, ningalukha endio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo aboburuchi shibamanyakhwo ewa ndatsia, kata aka ndakhola, ta; kata ndali nindashiaboolelakhwo abaYahudi, kata abakuhani, kata abamakuru, kata abandi bosi abakhakhola emilimo ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nimbasunjila mbu Muluutsi amasila aka khulimwo, shinga Yerusalemu olwa lili butswa likunda, ebilibwa bialio nibiasambwa nomulilo; chende khuswale olukoba IweYerusalemu, mbu khuleshenje okhuba linyeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbaboolela akomukhono kwaNyasaye wanje okwali khwisie okhuleera amalayi; khandi akamakhuwa aka omuruchi yali niyamboolela. Nabo nibasunga mbu Buushe, khuumbashe. Kho nibeetinyia amakhono khulwa emilimo echio emilayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa olwa Sanibalati omuHoroni naTobia omukhalabani, omuAmoni, naGeshemu omuArabu, bahulilakhwo, bakhutsesheelela, nibakhuchaya, bari Kho mukholanga shi? Mwenya okhukholela omuruchi induli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi ningalusia nimbasunjila mbu Nyasaye welikulu niye oulakhukhwania; niyeshichila ifwe abasumbabe nakhubuushe nikhuumbakha; habula inywe shimulikhwo nomukabo kwosi, kata akamukhoyeele, kata eshiitsulilo muYerusalemu ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
